{"seq":3,"slug":"market-fragmentation","title":"市场碎片化与最佳执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/modern-microstructure/market-fragmentation","wordCount":3239,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"市场碎片化与最佳执行\">市场碎片化与最佳执行</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>市场碎片化（Market Fragmentation）是指同一证券在多个交易场所同时交易的现象。在美国股票市场，一只股票可能同时在 NYSE、NASDAQ、BATS/Cboe 的多个交易所、十几个暗池以及数个批发做市商处交易。欧洲市场在 MiFID I/II 推动下经历了类似的碎片化过程。加密货币市场更是天然碎片化——同一代币可能在数百个全球交易所交易。</p>\n<p>碎片化是市场竞争的自然结果：多个交易场所竞争订单流，促使各场所降低费用、改善技术和创新服务。但碎片化也带来了挑战：流动性分散、寻找最优执行的复杂度增加、市场监控难度上升。<strong>最佳执行</strong>（Best Execution）义务正是在碎片化背景下应运而生的监管要求，旨在确保投资者在碎片化市场中获得公平对待。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>市场碎片化指同一证券在多个交易场所同时交易的现象，是竞争与技术进步的产物。围绕碎片化，需要把握几组核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>成本与收益的权衡</strong>：场所竞争压低费用、促进创新、降低系统风险，但流动性分散、搜索成本上升、监管套利与监控难度也随之增加；</li>\n<li><strong>整合机制</strong>：美国以 Reg NMS 的订单保护规则（Rule 611）和 NBBO/SIP 统一报价带整合，欧盟以 MiFID II 的最佳执行义务与 CTP 推进整合，但缺少统一订单保护规则；</li>\n<li><strong>智能订单路由（SOR）</strong>：依据报价深度、费率、历史填充率、速度等因素动态分配订单，现代 SOR 越来越多地用强化学习优化路由；</li>\n<li><strong>最佳执行义务</strong>：要求经纪商以&quot;合理努力&quot;为客户争取最优执行，通过 Rule 606 / RTS 28 等披露机制接受监督；</li>\n<li><strong>信息碎片化</strong>：碎片化不仅体现在订单流，也体现在信息（直接数据源 vs. SIP、跨链价格独立），构成延迟套利的来源。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>碎片化与整合在市场结构中不断动态摆动，对量化交易者而言，在其中导航需要先进基础设施、持续的执行质量监控与对监管变化的及时适应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"碎片化的全球格局\">碎片化的全球格局</h2><h3 id=\"美国股票市场\">美国股票市场</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[美国股票交易生态&lt;br/&gt;2025年] --&gt; B[交易所&lt;br/&gt;~60% 市场份额]&#10;    A --&gt; C[暗池/ATS&lt;br/&gt;~15-18%]&#10;    A --&gt; D[批发做市商&lt;br/&gt;~25-28%]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[NYSE 系列&lt;br/&gt;~23%]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[NASDAQ 系列&lt;br/&gt;~18%]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[Cboe 系列&lt;br/&gt;~15%]&#10;    B --&gt; B4[IEX&lt;br/&gt;~3%]&#10;    B --&gt; B5[MEMX&lt;br/&gt;~4%]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[~40 个活跃暗池]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[Citadel Securities&lt;br/&gt;~40% 散户流]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[Virtu Financial&lt;br/&gt;~25%]\">graph TD\n    A[美国股票交易生态&lt;br/&gt;2025年] --&gt; B[交易所&lt;br/&gt;~60% 市场份额]\n    A --&gt; C[暗池/ATS&lt;br/&gt;~15-18%]\n    A --&gt; D[批发做市商&lt;br/&gt;~25-28%]\n    B --&gt; B1[NYSE 系列&lt;br/&gt;~23%]\n    B --&gt; B2[NASDAQ 系列&lt;br/&gt;~18%]\n    B --&gt; B3[Cboe 系列&lt;br/&gt;~15%]\n    B --&gt; B4[IEX&lt;br/&gt;~3%]\n    B --&gt; B5[MEMX&lt;br/&gt;~4%]\n    C --&gt; C1[~40 个活跃暗池]\n    D --&gt; D1[Citadel Securities&lt;br/&gt;~40% 散户流]\n    D --&gt; D2[Virtu Financial&lt;br/&gt;~25%]</pre><p>美国拥有全球最碎片化的股票市场——超过 15 个交易所和 40 多个 ATS 竞争订单流。</p>\n<h3 id=\"欧洲市场\">欧洲市场</h3><p>MiFID I（2007）打破了各国交易所的垄断，催生了 MTF（Multilateral Trading Facility）的快速发展：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场所类型</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n<th>市场份额（2024）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主要交易所</td>\n<td>LSE、Euronext、Deutsche Börse、SIX</td>\n<td>~55%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MTF</td>\n<td>Cboe Europe、Turquoise、Aquis</td>\n<td>~25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暗池</td>\n<td>Liquidnet、POSIT、各银行暗池</td>\n<td>~8%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统性内部化商（SI）</td>\n<td>Citadel、Virtu、各银行 SI</td>\n<td>~12%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"加密货币市场\">加密货币市场</h3><p>加密货币市场的碎片化程度最高：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CEX</strong>：Binance、Coinbase、OKX 等数百个交易所</li>\n<li><strong>DEX</strong>：Uniswap、Curve、dYdX 等，分布在以太坊、Solana、BSC 等多条链上</li>\n<li><strong>场外（OTC）</strong>：Cumberland、Galaxy Digital 等 OTC 台</li>\n<li>同一交易对可能在 100+ 个场所交易</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"碎片化的成本与收益\">碎片化的成本与收益</h2><h3 id=\"收益\">收益</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>收益</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>证据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>降低交易费用</td>\n<td>场所竞争压低费用</td>\n<td>美国交易所费率从 2000 年代的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.005</mn><mo>+</mo><mtext>降至</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.005+ 降至</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.005</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">降至</span></span></span></span></span>0.002-0.003</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>促进创新</td>\n<td>新场所推出差异化功能</td>\n<td>IEX 速度减速带、MEMX 低费率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>改善执行质量</td>\n<td>多场所提供更多流动性来源</td>\n<td>价格改善机会增加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降低系统风险</td>\n<td>单一交易所故障不影响全市场</td>\n<td>2015 NYSE 技术故障时交易转移至其他场所</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"成本\">成本</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>严重程度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>流动性碎片化</td>\n<td>同一证券的流动性分散在多个场所</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜索成本增加</td>\n<td>投资者需要扫描多个场所寻找流动性</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术复杂度</td>\n<td>需要连接和管理多个场所</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监管套利</td>\n<td>不同场所规则差异被利用</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟套利</td>\n<td>信息传播延迟被高频交易者利用</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监控困难</td>\n<td>跨场所操纵更难检测</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"学术研究证据\">学术研究证据</h3><p>O&#39;Hara 和 Ye（2011）的经典研究发现美国市场的碎片化<strong>总体上改善了市场质量</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>碎片化程度更高的股票有<strong>更窄的有效价差</strong></li>\n<li>碎片化与<strong>更快的执行速度</strong>正相关</li>\n<li>但碎片化也与<strong>更高的短期波动性</strong>相关</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Degryse, De Jong 和 van Kervel（2015）对欧洲市场的研究得出类似但更细致的结论：<strong>明池碎片化</strong>改善市场质量，但<strong>暗池碎片化</strong>可能损害价格发现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"市场整合机制\">市场整合机制</h2><h3 id=\"美国-reg-nms\">美国：Reg NMS</h3><p>Reg NMS（Regulation National Market System, 2005/2007）是美国市场的核心整合框架：</p>\n<p><strong>Order Protection Rule（Rule 611）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>交易场所不得以劣于其他场所显示的最优报价（NBBO）的价格执行交易</li>\n<li>如果某交易所的最优卖价低于 NYSE 的最优卖价，那么路由到 NYSE 的买入市价单必须先被转路由到那个交易所</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>NBBO 的计算</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>National Best Bid</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>Y</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{National Best Bid} = \\max(Bid_{NYSE}, Bid_{NASDAQ}, Bid_{Cboe}, ...)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">National Best Bid</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">Q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oe</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p> </p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>National Best Offer</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>s</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>Y</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>s</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>s</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{National Best Offer} = \\min(Ask_{NYSE}, Ask_{NASDAQ}, Ask_{Cboe}, ...)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">National Best Offer</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">Q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oe</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def compute_nbbo(exchange_quotes):&#10;    best_bid = max(q[&#39;bid&#39;] for q in exchange_quotes if q[&#39;bid_size&#39;] &gt; 0)&#10;    best_ask = min(q[&#39;ask&#39;] for q in exchange_quotes if q[&#39;ask_size&#39;] &gt; 0)&#10;    return {&#39;bid&#39;: best_bid, &#39;ask&#39;: best_ask, &#39;mid&#39;: (best_bid + best_ask) / 2}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compute_nbbo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(exchange_quotes):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    best_bid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(q[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> q </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exchange_quotes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> q[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bid_size'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    best_ask </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(q[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ask'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> q </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exchange_quotes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> q[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ask_size'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: best_bid, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ask'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: best_ask, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (best_bid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> best_ask) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>SIP（Securities Information Processor）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>汇总所有交易所的报价和成交数据</li>\n<li>计算并发布 NBBO</li>\n<li>SIP 延迟约 100-300μs，比直接交易所数据源慢</li>\n<li>这一延迟差异是延迟套利的来源之一</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"欧盟-mifid-ii-整合机制\">欧盟：MiFID II 整合机制</h3><p>MiFID II 采用了不同于 Reg NMS 的方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最佳执行义务</td>\n<td>投资公司必须采取&quot;充分步骤&quot;获得最佳执行，但无具体的订单保护规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预交易透明度</td>\n<td>明池必须公开报价，暗池受 DVC 限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交易后透明度</td>\n<td>所有成交必须在 1 分钟内报告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CTP（统一报价带）</td>\n<td>欧盟长期追求建立类似 SIP 的统一数据源，2025 年仍在推进中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>欧盟缺少统一 NBBO 的影响</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>没有跨场所的订单保护规则</li>\n<li>最佳执行依赖各投资公司的自律</li>\n<li>价格发现效率可能低于美国</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"智能订单路由-sor\">智能订单路由（SOR）</h2><h3 id=\"sor-架构\">SOR 架构</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[客户订单] --&gt; B[智能订单路由器]&#10;    B --&gt; C{路由决策引擎}&#10;    C --&gt; D[明池路由]&#10;    C --&gt; E[暗池搜索]&#10;    C --&gt; F[跨交易所扫描]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[NYSE]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[NASDAQ]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[Cboe]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[暗池 1]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[暗池 2]&#10;    F --&gt; F1[跨市场套利检查]&#10;    B --&gt; G[实时反馈&lt;br/&gt;填充率/成本分析]&#10;    G --&gt; C\">graph TD\n    A[客户订单] --&gt; B[智能订单路由器]\n    B --&gt; C{路由决策引擎}\n    C --&gt; D[明池路由]\n    C --&gt; E[暗池搜索]\n    C --&gt; F[跨交易所扫描]\n    D --&gt; D1[NYSE]\n    D --&gt; D2[NASDAQ]\n    D --&gt; D3[Cboe]\n    E --&gt; E1[暗池 1]\n    E --&gt; E2[暗池 2]\n    F --&gt; F1[跨市场套利检查]\n    B --&gt; G[实时反馈&lt;br/&gt;填充率/成本分析]\n    G --&gt; C</pre><h3 id=\"sor-决策因素\">SOR 决策因素</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因素</th>\n<th>权重</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>报价价格和深度</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>直接数据源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交易费用（Maker/Taker）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>费率表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史填充率</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>内部统计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行速度</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>延迟监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信息泄露风险</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>暗池质量评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定性/可靠性</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>运维监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返佣/回扣</td>\n<td>低~中</td>\n<td>费率协议</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"先进-sor-技术\">先进 SOR 技术</h3><p><strong>机器学习驱动的路由优化</strong>：</p>\n<p>现代 SOR 使用强化学习动态优化路由决策：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>状态</strong>：各场所报价深度、历史填充率、当前市场状态</li>\n<li><strong>动作</strong>：订单分配比例（各场所分别多少量）</li>\n<li><strong>奖励</strong>：实际执行质量（价格改善、填充率、延迟）</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;&#10;class SmartOrderRouter:&#10;    def __init__(self, venues):&#10;        self.venues = venues&#10;        self.fill_rates = {v: 0.5 for v in venues}&#10;        self.avg_improvement = {v: 0.0 for v in venues}&#10;&#10;    def route(self, order, market_data):&#10;        scores = {}&#10;        for venue in self.venues:&#10;            quote = market_data[venue]&#10;            if order[&#39;side&#39;] == &#39;buy&#39;:&#10;                price_score = -quote[&#39;ask&#39;]&#10;            else:&#10;                price_score = quote[&#39;bid&#39;]&#10;&#10;            fill_score = self.fill_rates[venue]&#10;            improvement_score = self.avg_improvement[venue]&#10;            fee = self._get_fee(venue, order)&#10;&#10;            scores[venue] = (&#10;                0.4 * price_score +&#10;                0.3 * fill_score +&#10;                0.2 * improvement_score -&#10;                0.1 * fee&#10;            )&#10;&#10;        best_venue = max(scores, key=scores.get)&#10;        return best_venue&#10;&#10;    def update_stats(self, venue, was_filled, price_improvement):&#10;        alpha = 0.05&#10;        self.fill_rates[venue] = (1-alpha) * self.fill_rates[venue] + alpha * was_filled&#10;        self.avg_improvement[venue] = (1-alpha) * self.avg_improvement[venue] + alpha * price_improvement&#10;&#10;    def _get_fee(self, venue, order):&#10;        return 0.0003\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SmartOrderRouter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></s